  "summary": "High-quality implementation covering all major functional requirements. The code is well-structured with clean separation of concerns across SecretProvider, CachedSecretProvider, SecretRotationHelper, and the demo script. All Azure SDK patterns (LRO, pagination, async/await, identity-based auth) are correctly implemented. Three issues found: (1) RestError is not imported or used for type-safe error handling — uses generic 'error: any' instead of 'instanceof RestError', (2) @azure/logger is not used for SDK diagnostic logging, and (3) the RestError type-check criterion is failed for the same reason as #1.",
